  "prefLabel": "En 1804.02 Department Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1804.02 Department Responsibilities. The department shall review the application and shall:\n\n(a) Determine whether the applicant has demonstrated, pursuant to RSA 155-A, that the design of the residential building complies with the energy code; and\n\n(b) If the department determines compliance with the energy code, the department shall issue a verification letter to the municipality pursuant to RSA 155-A:10-a with a copy to the applicant.\n\nSource. #14381, eff 9-22-25, EXPIRES: 9-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1800.html"
